      "severity": "note",
      "summary": "The on-page Brain Dump capture field works perfectly: the string 'Idea: add a \"session recap\" email after each StoryForge game — players forget plot hooks (captured 2026-08-12)' (110 chars, straight quotes and em dash) came back character-for-character identical after capture, after /reload, and in a brand-new tab/session, with triage buttons (Task/Edit/Auto-process) attached so it can become real work without retyping."
    },
